{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "e41857489a3f9a5c7996a1cf3ec0ed31546541179212777709b6a6c2fdda1db3", "ja": "みんなのために、自分のために", "zh": "为了大家，为了自己", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d6d736fab5fe69fea6e7c5a71222b45da523fc4239d80a86872d450478369194", "ja": "新曲を聞き、これまでを振り返る恵美。\nなにより仲間を褒める恵美に、サポートだけ\nでなく恵美も一歩進んで輝いてほしいと語る\nプロデューサー。みんなともっと先に行く\nために……恵美は微笑んで頷いた。", "zh": "惠美听着新歌，回顾至今的一切。  \n制作人对一心夸奖伙伴的惠美说，希望她不只是作为支援，也能向前迈进一步，绽放光芒。  \n为了和大家一起走得更远……惠美微笑着点了点头。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "5ab37191a4fae954cd7b69826f8a0be3fa41d0ff16a3192286ec85147ce57613", "ja": "テレビ出演に向けて準備を進める中……", "zh": "为参加电视节目而做准备的过程中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "2022b149ffe809292e1787a93112eb3ca286c5af8bb58afa4e8e7d2460faf852", "ja": "フンフン～フンフン～♪", "zh": "哼哼～哼哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "b0ecbc53f0561027a2c6351809eb99dbed29c4a31edfebbbf4a24f66de98a057", "ja": "恵美、お疲れさま。", "zh": "恵美，辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "7c7c9b9d4098284439143a30e75b1c955a3aa11decfb560ffa36cb310b0459c3", "ja": "あ、プロデューサー。お疲れさま♪", "zh": "啊，制作人。辛苦啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1004_401pro", "source_sha256": "e824161041421ea523beb868059a420042e99eeb2acae887221aa6249c1892fa", "ja": "なんだかご機嫌だな。\n今のはTeam3rdの？", "zh": "你看起来心情不错啊。\n刚才那首是Team3rd的歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "3331af6637f46233f271e1f7c505f08b68cd98543b201c94192328673ad624c9", "ja": "うん、アタシたちの曲。\nホントいい曲だよね～。エモいっていうかさ。", "zh": "嗯，我们的歌。\n真的很棒呢～可以说很让人动情吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "52cb7ba1654d41390875fd8b290f6edfcfbab9533c3ff3360179b1d7c4a6679b", "ja": "まだデビューしたばっかなのに、\nいろいろ思い出して、泣けてくる感じ！", "zh": "明明才刚出道，却能让人想起好多事情，感觉都要哭出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1007_401pro", "source_sha256": "fb6df8e3880c1984145937f6c2006f048b939e689bcd3557ed9175bba63257ca", "ja": "そうだな……。\nいろんなことを、一気に駆け抜けてもらったから。", "zh": "是啊……毕竟让你们一口气经历了那么多事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "6b141597a773ec847dde14ec82f5fc719acc648a45d007a5beaf3492b6214157", "ja": "うん。劇場に来て、みんなの顔を覚えて……、\n急に原っぱでライブして。", "zh": "嗯。来到剧场，记住大家的脸……然后又突然在草原上办了演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "2cf52352c5da62d25243f3d57e259fe896e9569f409bbfbb20c92c62dc0336f1", "ja": "それから、Team3rdになって、南の島でバトって。\nで、写真集出して、今度はテレビ！", "zh": "然后成为Team3rd，在南方小岛上战斗。接着出了写真集，这次又上电视！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "beac4d45082ec906f7800ce92a5c804f0287495898862b520408f2798f0bbb5e", "ja": "アイドルって普通もっと大変だったりするんでしょ？\nみんなすごいよね～。", "zh": "偶像一般不是应该更辛苦的吗？大家都好厉害啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "ee45605a39fb38fb3f3ee52620d0cde7d3a6cc0e8387d6a903455d9155d3994e", "ja": "？　みんな？", "zh": "？大家？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "35106b44d6df30aa79800ad20682388b0c278818ab77d151c794d98430c53427", "ja": "うん！　うちのチームだと、琴葉は超しっかり者で\n頼りになるし、環は毎日元気いっぱいくれるし！", "zh": "嗯！在我们队里，琴叶特别可靠，做事又认真；环每天都能带来满满的活力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "25be7be7fcaec47ca0a6c4f26bc8ca2e04aae9f3e198a69750ecd352632d52ad", "ja": "風花は『優しい可愛いセクシー』の全部盛りだし～、\n百合子はさ、もういろんな意味で可愛いよね♪", "zh": "风花可是把“温柔、可爱、性感”全都集于一身了～\n百合子嘛，怎么说呢，她真的是各个方面都很可爱呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "8f7fa5bee56fa2347c87f854ee6f3b03bac296bf6a968f7c907e815fd342843e", "ja": "だから、なんか順調なのも分かるな～って。\nあ、一番すごいのはプロデューサーかもだけど♪", "zh": "所以，我也就明白为什么一切进展得这么顺利了～。\n啊，不过最厉害的可能还是制作人吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "4600dc3dc5c10dc17090b7a53916acb43b8c846f8f3c072766a7c2b8960397ed", "ja": "……どうかな。\nとりあえず、そういう恵美も十分すごいんだけど。", "zh": "……这可不好说。\n话说回来，这么说的惠美也已经足够厉害了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "5eafbc9fb3b32b02ef791f433e9e11a3c2bd19cbd46dfabfaa8fed8392a679ba", "ja": "え、アタシ？　いやアタシはすごくないでしょ～！\nみんなと一緒だったから、ここまで来れたっていうか。", "zh": "咦，我？不，我才没那么厉害呢～！\n该说是因为一直和大家在一起，才能走到今天吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "294267b9b2b07c3028b9fec2716498d27948e5517a57eb42ca237aeb4dc9cf1d", "ja": "こう、みんなについて来ただけって感じだもん。", "zh": "感觉就只是这样跟着大家走到现在而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "c3624f5e501cc74bde0176920e8f808a7eb1a25270a44f5d800a9adf7f907db5", "ja": "……なるほど。確かに恵美には、\nそういうところがあるかもしれないな。", "zh": "……原来如此。确实，恵美说不定\n还真有这么一面呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "db01e5ed4e088a5980c4ccd293eaf1ab3be8d1c33a7ed3519595c4feab57d007", "ja": "でしょ？", "zh": "对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1020_401pro", "source_sha256": "25cd8834c2faa1b34a5c4166fefe122253bdee3f2ea286cbc5acac1f4a3ca6eb", "ja": "うん。みんなについて行くっていう体で、\nさり気なく一歩下がって、後ろから見守ってくれて。", "zh": "嗯。以跟上大家为由，不着痕迹地退后一步，从后面守望着我们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1022_401pro", "source_sha256": "c59d34d3009a5ea69567fe080a5b6bbb254808c7efd2981a2cd09a4dcb601c1a", "ja": "誰かがつまづいたら、すぐに手を差し伸べてくれて。\nみんなが元気なら、ますます盛り上げて。", "zh": "只要有人跌倒，她就立刻伸出援手。\n大家精神好的时候，她就更加把气氛炒起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1023_401pro", "source_sha256": "1e726e4b15653fab026d14e45c70bdcaf28d3f1c8db0a93491b50ad260355950", "ja": "そうやってみんなを繋いで、笑顔にしてくれてる。\nやっぱり恵美もすごいよな！", "zh": "就这样把大家联系在一起，让大家露出笑容。\n果然惠美也很厉害啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "059287a675ae03cc418f9b9b754a06f49a27990753c352a68c59fc5370133a6c", "ja": "う……。そ、そういうのは……\n仲間なんだし、当たり前じゃんっ。", "zh": "呜……那、那种事……\n大家都是同伴，不是理所当然的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1025_401pro", "source_sha256": "5689e692a01caa69dd904c1a966fde173a99e48739e57fee1b682a936f7c8767", "ja": "それを当たり前って言えるのも、\n恵美のすごいところだ。", "zh": "能把这种事说成理所当然，也是惠美厉害的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "13296364a406da8bc87bf1d84cde0f2cdc84cbfa4639631bdc1885d1de99172b", "ja": "う……！　も～、さっきからなに？\nさては、アタシをおだてて遊んでるんでしょ！？", "zh": "呜……！真是的，你从刚才开始就怎么回事？\n该不会是故意夸我、拿我寻开心吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1027_401pro", "source_sha256": "ae7b60b6a54eab41c596037eaaddf81bbfaddf7f0547f7ded48df3333c647622", "ja": "いや、本当にそう思ってるだけだよ。\nそれに、思い出してほしいこともあるし。", "zh": "不，我只是实话实说而已。\n而且，也有想让你回忆起来的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "20bc948eb108c174c24b581942030b36f6aaf8197df27ed1b64269d90dd240a8", "ja": "？　思い出すって……\n何か忘れてたっけ？", "zh": "嗯？要我想起来……\n我忘了什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1029_401pro", "source_sha256": "e8ffd0650f0b7db174089d1249f9b9ab28865e91d9ba2346c3ed8f85a6537ba4", "ja": "うん。一応、恵美やみんなの後ろには俺がいるから。\n恵美は一歩下がるんじゃなくて……。", "zh": "嗯。毕竟恵美和大家的身后还有我在。\n恵美不用退后一步，而是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1030_401pro", "source_sha256": "b13bb404b924c99f5ce92d6b77d30e9b312516042c6b51313a236487a62e76f9", "ja": "一歩前に出て、肩を並べて歩いて行ってほしいんだ。\n恵美は、アイドルだから。", "zh": "我希望你向前迈出一步，和我并肩走下去。因为，惠美，你是偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1031_020meg", "source_sha256": "8525544f1f69e6d5e8741e3b8ab07d79a82eafb2e3cb61e80af92f0e93be915d", "ja": "……。それは……。", "zh": "……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1032_401pro", "source_sha256": "7afcde29c74a8547b234bfce58378ee21af3495fdbc39e61fb8c93611104df48", "ja": "一人一人が輝くことで、チームも最高に輝ける。\n仲間のためにも、恵美のファンのためにも……。", "zh": "每个人都闪耀起来，团队也能绽放出最耀眼的光芒。\n也是为了伙伴们，也是为了惠美的粉丝们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_03_1033_401pro", "source_sha256": "00f7219a4dab5741296971ab9ea75d087a693f2bdaaa5497ea442ac17fff0aa7", "ja": "何より、恵美のためにも。\n誰にも遠慮しないで、思いっきり輝いてくれよな！", "zh": "最重要的是，也要为了惠美。\n别顾虑任何人，尽情地闪耀吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
